{{Quote|Provides the user with a wide range of explosive attacks.|Shop}}
'''Bomb''' is a {{Common}} [[Natural]]-type [[Blox Fruit]] that costs {{Money|80,000}} or {{Robux|220}} from the [[Blox Fruit Dealer]].

The Bomb fruit allows the user to manipulate explosions for both offense and area control. The user can wield handheld projectiles, plant mines, and sacrifice their own health for higher damage.

