==Overview==
<tabber> 
|-|Pros=
{{Overview|Pros
|'''General'''
* Large AoE.
* Low cooldowns.
* Most moves can [[Instinct/Break|break Instinct]] and are multi-target.
* Cheap and easy to obtain.
* Decent damage overall, with some abilities dealing a lot of damage in certain situations.
* Excellent choice for eliminating certain [[Sea Events]].
* Surprisingly viable for [[PvP mechanics|PvP]].
* Good mobility, although the jump might damage the user.
* Great for grinding in early [[First Sea]].

|{{Ability|TAP}}
* Good [[Area of Effect|AoE]].
* Rather easy to use.
* Great damage. (Held)
* Medium knockback. 
* Multi-target.
* Breaks instinct.

|{{Ability|Z}}
* Decent reach and damage.
* Short cooldown.
* No wind up.
* Can be moved around quickly to chase a high speed opponent.
* Good for trolling purposes.

|{{Ability|X}}
* Good stun.
* Good combo potential.
* Similarly to [[Superhuman]] [C], this move has aim-assist.
* Can break combos and Instinct to the opponent.
* Can still deal damage when missed.

|{{Ability|C}}
* No knockback. (Held)
* Invisible to opponents. (Held)
* Can chain detonate after the latest rework. (Held)
* Can damage multiple enemies.
* Deals an insane amount of damage if in an enclosed space. (Tap)
* Can deal insane amounts of damage to large targets like [[Sea Beast|Sea Beasts]]. (Tap)
** Additionally, the low cooldown of the C move makes the user able to quickly kill Sea Beasts by spamming the C move only.

|{{Ability|V}}
* Absurdly high damage compared to the rest of the moveset.
* Large hitbox, especially when fully charged.
* Can be used for breaking combos if used correctly.
* This move cannot be cancelled even if the user takes damage or gets stunned.
* Excellent for getting [[Piranha|Piranhas]] off your boat trail.
* Knocks opponent extremely far away which makes it good for defensive purposes.
* Counters most combo moves like [[Portal]] Z or [[Yeti]] C when used correctly.

|{{Ability|F}}
* Decent [[Area of Effect|AoE]].
* Low cooldown. 
* Great mobility, being able to be spammed like [[Lightning]] F.
* Useful to avoid some moves, such as [[Dough]] '''[C]''' or [[Ice]] '''[V]'''.
* Travels very high when used vertically.
* Can be used to avoid the ocean.
}}

|-|Cons=
{{Overview|Cons
|'''General'''
* Lacks stun moves.
* Most moves are short-ranged.
* Most moves are very easy to predict while holding them.
** The user is immobile while holding their moves, leaving room for attack.
* Fruit requires relatively high mastery compared to other {{Common}} [[Blox Fruits|fruits]].
* Little to no combo potential.
* Very risky to rely on {{Ability|V}} and {{Ability|F}} for damage as they drain the user's health.
* The hitboxes can be very misleading when compared to the VFX.

|{{Ability|TAP}}
* Long cooldown compared to other [M1] attacks.
* Weird hitbox when using on enemies on the same leverage, if not higher leverage than the player. This can be fixed by slightly jumping before using it.

|{{Ability|Z}}
* Hard to use in air.
* Mediocre range.
* Medium damage.
* Difficult to hit.
* Rather small hitbox.

|{{Ability|X}}
* Medium range.
* Doesn't [[Instinct/Break|break Instinct]].
* Mostly single target.
* Randomly causes user to be flung in different directions.

|{{Ability|C}}
* The area is still too small when fighting in [[Second Sea]] and [[Third Sea]].
* Doesn't work in air. (Held)
* Takes some time to fully charge, leaving the user vulnerable to attacks.
* Decent end-lag if fully charged.
* Extremely unreliable damage, hitbox is inconsistent. (Tap)
* Rather small AoE.
* Can be countered by enemies that can run away fast enough after triggering the landmines. (Held)
* Sometimes the chain detonation causes only one landmine to hit the opponent. (Held)

|{{Ability|V}}
* Drains the user's [[health]] quickly.
* The user is left immobile for the duration of the move.
* Extremely high knockback, especially if fully charged.
** In grinding, using this move above [[enemies|NPCs]] will fix this issue.
* Extremely odd hitbox, often never landing in aerial combat.
* Difficult to land fully charged variant if the opponent is mobile.

|'''[F] Explosive Jump'''
* The user will take damage if spammed. However, using it when the text is white will negate this con.
* Cannot be controlled in the same way as other movement abilities.
}} 
</tabber>

