==Trivia==
* Bomb was reworked in [[Updates/17.3|Update 17.3]], whereas it previously only had two moves, it was changed to have six in total.
** The old version of Bomb is used by the boss [[Stone]], as well as the [[Sorcerer]] and [[Factory Staff]].
* The exclamation marks seen in Bomb's attacks are identical to the exclamation marks in the [[Fishing]] minigame.
* The inventory icon of the Bomb skins, with the exception of {{Skin|Celebration}}, is a little wider than the original icon.
* Accounting for the scaling damage, the user is able to use {{Ability|F}} a total of five times at max HP, with the sixth use subsequently killing the user.
* Bomb is one of the only {{Common}} Fruits to have an M1 attack, with the other one being [[Blade]].

